---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /whats-new/index.html
title: What's new in InEgypt
description: Dated release notes for InEgypt, newest first, in the same words as the App Store.
lang: en
navCt: web_whatsnew
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container guide__body">
    <header class="stack">
      <h1 style="font-size: var(--fs-h2)">What's new</h1>
      <p class="lead">Release notes, newest first, in the same words as the App Store.</p>
    </header>
    {%- if releases.items.length %}
    {%- for r in releases.items %}
    <article class="stack" id="v{{ r.version }}">
      <h2>Version {{ r.version }} <span class="small muted" style="font-family: var(--font-body); font-weight: 400">· <time datetime="{{ r.date }}">{{ r.date | monthYear }}</time></span></h2>
      {%- for p in r.notes %}<p>{{ p }}</p>{% endfor %}
    </article>
    {%- endfor %}
    {%- else %}
    <div class="missing" style="border-radius: var(--r-card)" data-missing="release-notes"><span><b>Release notes</b>to paste from App Store Connect, word for word (src/_data/releases.json)</span></div>
    {%- endif %}
    <p><a href="{{ 'web_whatsnew' | appLink }}">InEgypt on the App Store <span class="flip-rtl">→</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>
